software-workflow demonstration, including generic classes and vehicle
entries. They are not an official technical reference and must not be used
in forensic applications without independent verification against an
appropriate source. No scientific source or validation is asserted for these
illustrative values. Future releases may replace or update them with
documented, referenced values. This statement does not apply to the separate
NHTSA-derived library described above.
